flowchart TB
    accTitle: Payment ownership and error boundary
    accDescr: Browser and replay-safe webhook requests reach the financial application service, select an operation-specific scoped lookup, disclose the same 404 for missing and non-owned resources, and map typed state failures through the shared RFC 9457 adapter.

    Browser["Browser caller"] --> Security["Spring Security"]
    Security --> Http["Financial HTTP adapter"]
    Http --> Application["Financial application service"]
    Webhook["Authenticated replay-safe webhook"] --> Application

    Application --> Lookup["Operation-specific scoped lookup: participant, payment actor, or provider callback"]
    Lookup --> Scope{"Resource within selected scope?"}
    Scope -->|"No"| NotFound["Uniform entity-specific 404"]
    Scope -->|"Yes"| State["Evaluate state, expiry, method, and provider"]
    State --> Transition["Conditional transactional transition"]
    State --> Error["Typed financial exception"]
    Error --> Adapter["Shared RFC 9457 adapter"]
    Adapter --> Problem["Allowlisted Problem Details"]

    Browser ~~~ Webhook

    classDef error fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:2px
    classDef success fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px
    class NotFound,Error,Problem error
    class Transition success
